<%- include('partials/header') %>
<section class="hero-new"><div class="hero-copy"><span class="kicker">INDORE'S ACCOUNTABLE ANIMAL-CARE NETWORK</span><h1>Every animal deserves a <em>safe next step.</em></h1><p>Discover adoptable animals, reach verified rescuers and respond to urgent cases—with clearer accountability at every stage.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/animals">Explore listings</a><a class="button button-soft" href="/animals/new">Report an animal</a></div><div class="trust-line"><span>✓ Verified network</span><span>✓ Traceable listings</span><span>✓ Responsible adoption</span></div></div><div class="hero-visual"><img src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Indian%20Street%20Dog.jpg?width=1100" alt="An Indian street dog"><div class="floating-card"><strong><%= stats.animals || 0 %> active paths</strong><span>from street to safety</span></div></div></section>
<section class="pathways"><a href="/animals"><span>01</span><h2>All listings</h2><p>Adoption, fostering and community-care cases.</p><b>Browse →</b></a><a href="/profiles"><span>02</span><h2>Verified network</h2><p>Rescuers, veterinary partners and organisations.</p><b>Meet them →</b></a><a class="path-sos" href="/sos"><span>03</span><h2>Urgent SOS</h2><p>Time-sensitive medical, transport and foster needs.</p><b>Help now →</b></a><a class="path-map" href="/map"><span>04</span><h2>Live map</h2><p>Animals, clinics, rescuers and shelters across India.</p><b>Open map →</b></a></section>
<section class="map-story" data-map-story>
  <div class="map-story-stage">
    <div class="story-map-frame">
      <div class="story-map-copy"><span class="kicker">THE WHOLE NETWORK, IN MOTION</span><h2>Follow the path to help.</h2></div>
      <div id="homeStoryMap" class="pawpath-map story-map" data-paw-map data-mini-map aria-label="Preview of the PawPath map"></div>
      <div class="puppy-track" aria-hidden="true"><span class="paw-print">• • • •</span><img src="/images/puppy-run.svg" alt=""></div>
      <a class="story-map-link" href="/map">Explore the full map <span>↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="map-story-steps">
    <article class="map-story-step is-active" data-story-step="0"><span>01 / DISCOVER</span><h3>See the whole care network.</h3><p>Move from India-wide context to neighbourhood-level action without losing your place.</p></article>
    <article class="map-story-step" data-story-step="1"><span>02 / GET CLOSER</span><h3>Zoom into listings near you.</h3><p>Dog and cat pins separate everyday listings from urgent SOS cases that need immediate attention.</p></article>
    <article class="map-story-step" data-story-step="2"><span>03 / FIND SUPPORT</span><h3>Clinics, rescuers and shelters—one tap away.</h3><p>Switch to the Network layer to find source-checked help, then open a record for contact and trust details.</p></article>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section feed-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="kicker">EXPLORE</span><h2>Animals waiting for their next chapter</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/animals">View all listings →</a></div><div class="listing-grid"><% animals.slice(0,8).forEach(animal => { %><%- include('partials/animal-card', { animal }) %><% }) %></div></section>
<section class="profiles-band"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="kicker">TRUSTED NETWORK</span><h2>People doing the work</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/profiles">See everyone →</a></div><div class="profile-row"><% profiles.forEach(profile => { %><a class="profile-mini" href="/profiles/<%= profile.id %>"><div class="profile-mini-initial"><%= profile.username.charAt(0).toUpperCase() %></div><div><strong><%= profile.username %> <span class="verified-dot">✓</span></strong><small><%= profile.entity_type || profile.role %></small><span><%= profile.listing_count %> listing<%= Number(profile.listing_count)===1?'':'s' %></span></div></a><% }) %></div></section>
<section class="sos-band"><div><span class="kicker">NEEDS HELP NOW</span><h2>Urgency needs visibility.</h2><p>These cases need transport, treatment, supplies or temporary shelter—not silent scrolling.</p><a class="button button-light" href="/sos">Open SOS board</a></div><div class="sos-list"><% urgent.forEach(animal => { %><a href="/animals/<%= animal.id %>"><img src="<%= animal.photo_url %>" alt="<%= animal.name %>"><div><b><%= animal.name %></b><span><%= animal.locality %></span></div><strong>Help →</strong></a><% }) %></div></section>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
